    <!-- Section 3: 프롬프트 엔지니어링 -->
    <section class="prompt-section" aria-labelledby="prompt-guide">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-tag tag-green">실전 프롬프트</span>
        <h2 id="prompt-guide">개발자 프롬프트 엔지니어링</h2>
        <p>AI에게 더 좋은 코드를 얻어내는 프롬프트 작성법</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="prompt-card">
          <div class="prompt-card-header">
            <div class="prompt-number">1</div>
            <div>
              <div class="prompt-title">컨텍스트 제공 템플릿</div>
              <div class="prompt-subtitle">기술 스택과 목표를 명확히 전달</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="code-block">
            <span class="comment"># 프로젝트 구조를 명시</span><br>
            I made 2 folders backend and frontend<br>
            <span class="comment"># 기술 스택 명시</span><br>
            backend: <span class="string">Spring Boot 3.x, port 8080</span><br>
            frontend: <span class="string">Vite + React, port 5173</span><br>
            <span class="comment"># 구체적 요청</span><br>
            <span class="keyword">plz complete</span> OAuth2 Google login flow<br>
            callback: <span class="string">http://localhost:8080/login/oauth2/code/google</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="prompt-card">
          <div class="prompt-card-header">
            <div class="prompt-number">2</div>
            <div>
              <div class="prompt-title">에러 디버깅 프롬프트</div>
              <div class="prompt-subtitle">에러 메시지 + 환경 정보 함께 전달</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="code-block">
            <span class="keyword">Environment:</span><br>
            - OS: macOS Sonoma<br>
            - Node.js: <span class="string">v20.11.0</span><br>
            - Package: <span class="string">express 4.18.2</span><br>
            <br>
            <span class="keyword">Error message:</span><br>
            <span class="string">TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined</span><br>
            <span class="comment">  at router.get (/routes/index.js:15:5)</span><br>
            <br>
            <span class="comment"># 내가 시도한 것과 예상 동작을 명시</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="prompt-card">
          <div class="prompt-card-header">
            <div class="prompt-number">3</div>
            <div>
              <div class="prompt-title">코드 리뷰 요청</div>
              <div class="prompt-subtitle">보안·성능·가독성 기준 명시</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="code-block">
            <span class="keyword">Review this code for:</span><br>
            1. <span class="string">Security</span> (SQL injection, XSS, auth bypass)<br>
            2. <span class="string">Performance</span> (N+1 queries, memory leaks)<br>
            3. <span class="string">Readability</span> (naming, complexity)<br>
            4. <span class="string">Best practices</span> (SOLID, clean code)<br>
            <br>
            <span class="comment"># 코드를 붙여넣기</span><br>
            <span class="keyword">Output in Korean please.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="prompt-card">
          <div class="prompt-card-header">
            <div class="prompt-number">4</div>
            <div>
              <div class="prompt-title">테스트 코드 생성</div>
              <div class="prompt-subtitle">테스트 프레임워크와 커버리지 기준 명시</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="code-block">
            <span class="keyword">Generate unit tests for this function:</span><br>
            <span class="comment"># 함수 코드 붙여넣기</span><br>
            <br>
            <span class="string">Framework:</span> Jest + Testing Library<br>
            <span class="string">Cover:</span> happy path, edge cases, error cases<br>
            <span class="string">Style:</span> describe/it/expect pattern<br>
            <span class="string">Mock:</span> external API calls<br>
            <br>
            <span class="comment"># AAA 패턴(Arrange-Act-Assert) 적용</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

